class=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">P</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msup><mi>σ</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch11-inner-products/07-isometries-and-unitary-maps.html"}